    <h2 id="section-5">Relationships</h2>
    <p>TODO</p>

    <h2 id="section-6">Trivia</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>He's vegetarian for the most part. He won't eat meat unless it's the ONLY option available, and even then, he probably won't unless it's something like bugs or other unconventional protein sources.</li>
      <!-- No, he won't eat shit. Don't fucking ask about that. -->
      <li>He still insists he <i>could</i> sing well from his choir days, but due to being so out of practice, he refuses to prove it.</li>
      <li>Despite his obedience to rules, he sometimes delivers blunt, accidental roasts without even realizing how harsh they sound.</li>
      <li>He will <b>NOT</b> be your chicken jockey.</li>
    </ul>
    <br/>
  </main>
</div>
</BaseLayout>










